### Dashboard autenticado
GET {{baseURL}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### Dashboard sem token
GET {{baseURL}}/dashboard

### Área admin como usuário comum
GET {{baseURL}}/dashboard/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### Área admin como admin
GET {{baseURL}}/dashboard/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### Listar eventos (público)
GET {{baseURL}}/events

### Criar evento como usuário comum
POST {{baseURL}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mutirão Ambiental",
  "category": "ambiental",
  "location": "IFRS",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-01",
  "capacity": 50
}

### Criar evento com dados inválidos como admin - 400
POST {{baseURL}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sem capacidade",
  "category": "ambiental",
  "location": "IFRS",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-01",
  "capacity": 0
}

### Criar evento como admin
POST {{baseURL}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mutirão Ambiental",
  "category": "ambiental",
  "location": "IFRS",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-01",
  "capacity": 50
}

### Atualizar evento como admin
PUT {{baseURL}}/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Doação de sangue (atualizado)",
  "category": "Doação",
  "location": "Porto Alegre",
  "eventDate": "2026-10-16",
  "capacity": 500
}

### Excluir evento como admin
DELETE {{baseURL}}/events/5
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### Listar voluntários
GET {{baseURL}}/volunteers
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}

### Cadastrar voluntário
POST {{baseURL}}/volunteers
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "maria@gmail.com",
  "telephone": "(54) 98888-7777"
}

### Inscrever voluntário em evento com vagas
POST {{baseURL}}/events/4/volunteers
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "volunteer_id": 1
}

### Inscrever o mesmo voluntário de novo no evento
POST {{baseURL}}/events/4/volunteers
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "volunteer_id": 1
}

### Inscrever segundo voluntário no evento com capacidade 2
POST {{baseURL}}/events/4/volunteers
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "volunteer_id": 2
}

### Inscrever terceiro voluntário em evento lotado (capacidade 2) - 409
POST {{baseURL}}/events/4/volunteers
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "volunteer_id": 3
}

### Excluir voluntário
DELETE {{baseURL}}/volunteers/2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser}}
